### Get Client Balance (Initial)
# Verify initial balance for Client 1 (Should be 500,000)
GET http://localhost:8080/clients/1

###

### Subscribe to Fund
# Client 1 subscribes to Fund 1 (MinAmount: 75,000)
# Balance should become 500,000 - 75,000 = 425,000
POST http://localhost:8080/funds/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "1",
  "fundId": "1"
}

###

### Get Client Balance (After Subscription)
# Verify balance is now 425,000
GET http://localhost:8080/clients/1

###

### Get Transaction History (After Subscription)
# Should show the subscription transaction
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/history/1

###

### Cancel Subscription
# Client 1 cancels subscription to Fund 1
# Balance should return to 500,000 (425,000 + 75,000)
POST http://localhost:8080/funds/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "1",
  "fundId": "1"
}

###

### Get Client Balance (After Cancellation)
# Verify balance is back to 500,000
GET http://localhost:8080/clients/1

###

### Get Transaction History (After Cancellation)
# Should show both subscription and cancellation transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/history/1
